# Per-workspace-member Cargo.lock files must NOT be tracked: Cargo uses the
# workspace-root Cargo.lock for every member. Tracking a divergent local lock
# (e.g. fluxion-mcp/Cargo.lock with different anyhow/rand versions) makes
# `cargo update -p foo` from inside the member silently revert the next
# workspace-root build. See issue #2931.
fluxion-mcp/Cargo.lock
/crates/*/Cargo.lock

